{"severity":"error","file":"errors/codec_missing_3.march","start_line":17,"start_col":16,"end_line":17,"end_col":19,"message":"The `@[remote]` actor `Counter` receives `Bump` from other nodes as a `Hit`, which has no JSON codec.\nA remote message crosses the network as JSON, and its type's name is its wire tag.","code":"codec_missing","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":["Add `derive Json for Hit` next to its declaration."],"category":"ACTOR"}
